      "description": "原生 SegmentedTabs 样式的静态任务选中预览；实际交互必须使用原生组件，预览不替代键盘状态机。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"长文工作流程预览\"><span class=\"ds-indicator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">文档</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">修改</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">检索</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">生成</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">任务</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tabs{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));padding:4px;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-lg);background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-module-platform)}.ds-indicator{position:absolute;inset:4px auto 4px 4px;box-sizing:border-box;width:calc((100% - 8px)/5);transform:translateX(400%);border:.5px solid var(--dsw-alias-border-l3);border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-md);background:var(--dsw-alias-bg-layer-3);transition:transform 180ms ease;pointer-events:none}.ds-tab{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;height:34px;padding:0 12px;border:none;border-radius:var(--dsw-radius-md);corner-shape:round;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;background:transparent;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-secondary);transition:color 180ms ease}.ds-tab:hover,.ds-tab[aria-selected=\"true\"]{background:transparent;color:var(--dsw-alias-label-primary)}.ds-tab[aria-selected=\"true\"]{font-weight:600}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:none;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-indicator,.ds-tab{transition:none}}"
